      "summary": {
        "name": "Hotel Equities",
        "legal_name": "Hotel Equities Group, LLC.",
        "description": "Hotel Equities (HE) is a best-in-class hospitality management company with a diverse portfolio of premium-branded and independent\u00a0hotels, resorts, and outdoor hospitality destinations throughout the United States, Canada, the Caribbean, and Latin America (CALA). We deliver proven results and drive long-term value for stakeholders through a comprehensive suite of services, a people-first and performance-driven culture, and a commitment to excellence.\n\nOver 11,000+ dynamic HE associates execute on our mission daily; to make a distinctive difference in people's lives.",
        "overview": "Hotel Equities (HE) is an award-winning hotel development, ownership and management company.  For 30 years, our team has collaborated with premier brands and entrepreneurial owners to deliver best in class results.  HE is hyper focused on managing upper midscale and full-service hotels in the U.S and Canada.  Whether we\u2019re executing ground-up development, re-positioning a property or managing one of the 135+ hotels in our portfolio, HE provides the highest and best value for owners, while prioritizing guest satisfaction and profitability.  Over 2500+ dynamic HE associates execute on our mission daily; to make a distinctive difference in people's lives.",
        "seo": "Choose the management team at Hotel Equities when you want to expand your hotels company brand like never before.",
